        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "={\n  \"contents\": [\n    {\n      \"parts\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"You are an expert cold email copywriter for an AI automation agency based in India that builds n8n workflow automations for businesses.\\n\\nHere is information about a business lead:\\n- Name: {{ $json.first_name }} {{ $json.last_name }}\\n- Company: {{ $json.company_name }}\\n- Industry: {{ $json.industry }}\\n- Website Content: {{ $json.website_text }}\\n\\nYour task:\\n1. Analyze their website content and identify ONE specific operational or business process that could clearly benefit from AI automation\\n2. Write a cold outreach email from the perspective of an AI automation specialist\\n\\nRules for the email:\\n- Subject line must be specific to their business, not generic\\n- Opening line must reference something real and specific from their website — not generic flattery\\n- Mention the specific pain point you identified\\n- Briefly explain how AI workflow automation solves it\\n- End with one soft call to action asking for a 15 minute call\\n- Total email body must be between 120 and 160 words\\n- Tone must be professional but conversational — not salesy\\n- Do not use words like 'revolutionize' or 'transform' or 'game-changer'\\n\\nRespond ONLY with a valid JSON object in this exact format, no extra text, no markdown, no code blocks:\\n{\\\"subject\\\": \\\"email subject line here\\\", \\\"body\\\": \\\"full email body here\\\", \\\"pain_point_identified\\\": \\\"one sentence describing the pain point you found\\\", \\\"personalization_hook\\\": \\\"the specific thing from their website you referenced\\\"}\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"generationConfig\": {\n    \"temperature\": 0.7,\n    \"maxOutputTokens\": 1000\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
